'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page two of the [[Servants of Freedom Premium Warbond#Page 2|Servants of Freedom]] Premium [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|25|notext}} and 7 [[Medal]]s.

== Trivia ==
* Both capes and player cards from the Servants of Freedom warbond are named for each half of the phrase "[[Fre Liberam|fre liberam]] per democrasum", a pseudo-Latin motto that translates to "freedom through democracy".
** Both armor sets from the warbond are also inscribed with the full phrase.
** The full phrase is a lyric from "[[March of the Helldivers]]".

